NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT License covers the SOFTWARE in this repository: the extraction,
cleaning, attribution, resolution, audit and statistics pipeline under src/,
and the curation files under docs/.

It does NOT cover the packaged dataset the pipeline produces. That dataset is
distributed separately via Zenodo under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0); see https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22086439.

The underlying Bundesrat Plenarprotokolle are official documents of the
Bundesrat (amtliche Werke) and are not subject to copyright under section 5 of
the German Copyright Act (UrhG).
